Wrote the single row for the `taxes` topic. SB 1828 (2021) is an omnibus ("omnibus; taxation") touching unrelated tax subjects — UI wage base, income tax brackets, property assessment ratio, several tax credits, fire district levy caps — so under V4.1 all three record passages (sponsor, vote, bill text) code as `multi-subject`, disqualifying them at V4 with no Mesnard statement to tie the act to one clause. Row is `BLANK / no-evidence`, with the needed source noted (his own words tying the vote/sponsorship to a specific provision).
